== External and OpenStep slots in the instance
123: hasse : External "Hasse 1933-36: |p + 1 - N_p| <= 2 sqrt p for every elliptic curve over F_p (nonsingular points at bad p)"
217: cont : External "modularity (Wiles 1995, Taylor-Wiles 1995, Breuil-Conrad-Diamond-Taylor 2001) with Hecke's theory:
219: fe : External "modularity with Hecke's theory: the completed L-function satisfies xi(2 - s) = w xi(s)"
221: weak : External "weak Mordell-Weil (Mordell 1922, Weil 1929): E(Q)/2E(Q) is finite; not in Mathlib" (WeakMordellWeil W)
240: Open i := OpenStep "BSD: the rank of E(Q) equals the order of the zero of L(E, s) at s = 1" (BSDStatement i.W i.Λ)
249: External "Gross-Zagier 1986, Kolyvagin 1988-90, with modularity: analytic rank 0 or 1 implies rank = analytic rank"
262: goldfeld : External "Goldfeld 1982: if the partial Euler products at s = 1 of the curve grow like C (log x)^r, then
270: Open i := OpenStep "the partial products of N_p/p grow like C (log p)^rank" (i.D.Balance (algRank i.W))
332: cont : External "Deuring 1953-56 (complex multiplication: a Hecke L-function), or modularity: continuation"
334: fe : External "Deuring / Hecke: functional equation of the completed L-function, conductor 32" (FunctionalEquation 32 Λ w)
335: nonvanish : External "L(E, 1) = 0.6555... is not 0 (modular symbols: L(E, 1)/Omega is the rational 1/4)" (Λ 1 ≠ 0)
336: finite : External "Fermat: 1 is not a congruent number (descent); E(Q) = {O, (0, 0), (1, 0), (-1, 0)}"
